---
import { site } from '../config';
---

<section id="how" class="section" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
        <h2 id="how-title">Three steps, one schema per app<span class="dot">.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">
        A <strong>schema</strong> is a short, machine-readable description of what an ad is allowed to look like
        inside one specific app. Everything else follows from it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step">
        <figure class="visual" aria-label="Example schema for a planner app">
          <pre><code><span class="k">format</span>     time_block
<span class="k">placement</span>  free slot, tomorrow
<span class="k">duration</span>   60 min
<span class="k">title</span>      ≤ 40 characters
<span class="k">claims</span>     time, place, price
<span class="k">label</span>      "Ad" — required
<span class="k">actions</span>    add, dismiss</code></pre>
        </figure>
        <div class="text">
          <p class="num">Step 1</p>
          <h3>The app defines its schema</h3>
          <p>
            When an app joins, it describes its ad format once: the shape, where it can appear, length limits, and
            which claims are allowed. This planner says an ad is a one-hour block in a free slot.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step">
        <figure class="visual" aria-label="An advertiser entering their website address">
          <div class="signup">
            <p class="field-label">Your website</p>
            <div class="field">https://ostra.example</div>
            <div class="submit">Submit</div>
          </div>
        </figure>
        <div class="text">
          <p class="num">Step 2</p>
          <h3>The advertiser submits their site</h3>
          <p>
            An advertiser signs up once and gives their website. That’s the brief. No banners to design, no separate
            creative for every app.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step">
        <figure class="visual" aria-label="Two generated drafts: one passes validation, one is rejected">
          <ul class="drafts">
            <li class="draft pass">
              <span class="ad-label">Ad</span>
              <span class="title">Lunchtime mobility class</span>
              <span class="status">✓ Fits schema</span>
            </li>
            <li class="draft fail">
              <span class="ad-label">Ad</span>
              <span class="title">The city’s best class, guaranteed results</span>
              <span class="status">✕ Claim not allowed · 42 chars</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </figure>
        <div class="text">
          <p class="num">Step 3</p>
          <h3>AI drafts ads, the schema checks them</h3>
          <p>
            An AI workflow reads the site and drafts ads for each app’s schema. Every draft is validated before it can
            serve. Drafts that don’t fit never run.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p class="after">
      <strong>Then:</strong> the ad is offered inside the app, in the app’s own format. The advertiser pays when
      someone accepts it or acts on it, not when it’s shown.
      <span class="fine">{`The schema shown is illustrative; ${site.name}’s format isn’t final.`}</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .steps {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
  .step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .visual {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    min-height: 220px;
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .text {
    padding: 24px 28px 30px;
  }
  .num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .text h3 {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .text p:last-child {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  pre {
    margin: 0;
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 16px 18px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    overflow-x: auto;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .k {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .signup {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
  }
  .field-label {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .field {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .submit {
    margin-top: 10px;
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--bg);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 9px 18px;
  }

  .drafts {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    width: 100%;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .draft {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 6px 10px;
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 12px 14px;
  }
  .draft .title {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .draft .status {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
  }
  .pass .status {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .fail {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .fail .title {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    text-decoration-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .fail .status {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .after {
    margin-top: 32px;
    max-width: 72ch;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .after strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .fine {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
